<div class="public-page">
  <header class="public-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Football Player Market home"><span
      class="brand-mark"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >FM</span>
    Football Market</a>
    <nav class="public-account-links" aria-label="Account">
      <a class="text-link" href="/sign-in">Sign in</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/register">Create account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="home-main">
    <section class="home-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">THE GAME, IN YOUR PORTFOLIO</p>
        <h1>Football Player Market<span class="title-dot">.</span></h1>
        <p class="intro-copy">Follow performance. Build your position.</p>
        <p class="muted">
          A player token market where football performance determines the quote. Keep track of your holdings and set the terms for your next purchase.
        </p>
        <a class="primary-button" href="/portfolio">Open your portfolio
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <aside class="market-note" aria-label="How the market works">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE RULES OF PLAY</p>
        <div class="supply-number">100<span>tokens per player</span></div>
        <p>
          A fixed supply. Quotes based on football performance. Every position starts with a player.
        </p>
        <div class="league-list">
          Premier League · Bundesliga · La Liga<br />Serie A · Ligue 1
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
    <section class="home-tools" aria-label="Your workspace">
      <a href="/portfolio"><span class="tool-number">01 / HOLDINGS</span><h2>
        Your portfolio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </h2><p>Review token quantities, current values and profit or loss in one place.</p></a>
      <a href="/conditional-orders"><span class="tool-number">02 / ORDERS</span><h2>
        Your price. Your terms. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </h2><p>Set a maximum purchase price, a quantity and an expiry for a conditional order.</p></a>
    </section>
    <p class="home-footnote">
      Conditional orders do not reserve credits or tokens. A qualifying price does not guarantee a purchase.
    </p>
  </main>
  <footer class="public-footer">
    <span>Football Market · Player tokens</span><a href="/docs">API documentation ↗</a>
  </footer>
</div>
